https://gitcode.com/sakuraqqz"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167023846,"discussion_id":"67716d8c46a7ce4eea4b776b23a8f2eaf5f7f6f5","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-31T20:08:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-31T20:08:57+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167023890,"discussion_id":"3ea409088b51f40fdd570142bacdf6330ee489ee","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复 `aclnnEqual` 算子在工作空间大小计算函数中，当输入张量的数据类型提升结果为 BF16 时，后续 `Cast` 操作可能不支持该类型而导致的潜在错误。该修改确保了算子内部 `Cast` 操作的兼容性和计算流程的稳定性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在 `aclnnEqualGetWorkspaceSize` 函数中，获取输入张量的提升数据类型 `promoteType` 后，增加条件判断：若 `promoteType` 为 `DT_BF16`，则将其显式修改为 `DT_FLOAT`。此调整保证了后续 `Cast` 操作接收到的目标数据类型是受支持的，从而避免了因底层 `Cast` 算子可能不支持 BF16 到 BF16 转换而引发的内部错误。","created_at":"2026-03-31T20:09:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-31T20:09:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167024002,"discussion_id":"14cbfcba3196da78f334743d62d3194a196f413c","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=baa35b32363740f6b9f960db67777bd8&pipelineRunId=530a9b018d67459f864777a9a023a772&projectName=CANN'>530a9b018d67459f864777a9a023a772</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下